   "lines": [
    "In the afternoon Van",
    "Ransaeler[?] & I called",
    "on the Lanes, taking",
    "Miss Luly & Miss Kitty (&",
    "Mrs. Lane) round to see",
    "Van's R[?] room & mine.",
    "We then played lawn",
    "tennis; and stayed to",
    "tea and spent the",
    "evening, dancing till I was nearly ^dead^.",
    "My horse is hopelessly",
    "lame and I am going",
    "to send him back to",
    "New York. It is fright-",
    "fully tough luck; but",
    "I deserved it. I miss",
    "having him to ride",
    "horribly."
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
   "confidence": "medium",
   "note": "\"till I was nearly\" squeezed in small at line end; \"dead\" written above at the margin."
